{#
  Rail toggle (2.48, theme partial `rail_toggle`): collapses an in-page column (a page tree, a filter column) to a thin
  rail and expands it again. Put it inside the column, the host element, which carries
  `data-nowo-ui-rail-host data-nowo-ui-rail="expanded|collapsed"`; mark what disappears in the rail with
  `data-nowo-ui-rail-body` (the kit CSS hides it, display: none, so it leaves the tab order and the accessibility tree;
  the toggle stays). The host's collapsed width is --nowo-ui-rail-width (2.75rem). js/nowo-ui-rail.js (opt-in
  `script_names` entry `rail`) toggles in place; without it, `href` makes the toggle a link to the other state.
  Slots: rail_toggle.

  Required:
    - target: id of the element that collapses (aria-controls)
    - title (View\Label|string): the column's name ("Pages"); part of the labels and shown vertically in the rail
  Optional:
    - collapsed (bool, default false): rendered collapsed (aria-expanded="false")
    - href: URL of the other state (no-JavaScript path); without it a button (JavaScript only). Checked by
      nowo_ui_safe_href() (relative, http, https, mailto): any other scheme (javascript:, data:…) renders the button
    - side: start (default; the column is at the start) | end: the chevron's direction
    - labels: {collapse, expand} (View\Label|string; defaults "Collapse %title%" / "Expand %title%")
    - show_title (bool, default true): the vertical title in the rail (aria-hidden: the label names the control)
    - persist: key (1-64 of A-Z a-z 0-9 _ . : -) for the localStorage fallback (`nowo-ui-rail:<key>`), applied on start
      (before the first paint with js/nowo-ui-layout-state.js in <head>). Only when the host has no store.
    - state_url / state_token / state_panel: the host store (primary): js/nowo-ui-rail.js POSTs
      `{panel: state_panel ?? persist ?? host id, open: <collapsed>}` as JSON with `X-CSRF-Token: state_token`; the
      server renders `collapsed` from the same store. With state_url, localStorage is never used. state_url is checked
      by nowo_ui_safe_href() (a refused value renders no store attributes); js/nowo-ui-rail.js only POSTs to a URL of
      the page's own origin.
    - shortcut: keyboard shortcut (e.g. `Alt+Shift+P`; none by default), exposed as aria-keyshortcuts
    - attr: root attributes, `class` added to the slot classes; checked by nowo_ui_safe_attrs() (no on*, style,
      srcdoc or script-running URLs). The attributes the partial owns (href, role, type, aria-controls, aria-expanded,
      aria-keyshortcuts, data-nowo-ui-rail-*) are dropped from it, so they are neither printed twice nor changed.
    - bundle
#}
{% set _b = bundle|default(null) %}
{% set _collapsed = (collapsed ?? false) is same as(true) %}
{% set _side = (side ?? 'start') == 'end' ? 'end' : 'start' %}
{% set _title = title|nowo_ui_trans %}
{% set _labels = labels|default({}) %}
{% set _collapse = _labels.collapse is defined ? _labels.collapse|nowo_ui_trans : 'rail.collapse'|trans({'%title%': _title}, 'NowoUiKitBundle') %}
{% set _expand = _labels.expand is defined ? _labels.expand|nowo_ui_trans : 'rail.expand'|trans({'%title%': _title}, 'NowoUiKitBundle') %}
{% set _href = nowo_ui_safe_href(href|default(null)) %}
{% set _attr = nowo_ui_safe_attrs(attr|default({}), ['href', 'role', 'type', 'aria-controls', 'aria-expanded', 'aria-keyshortcuts', 'data-nowo-ui-rail-toggle', 'data-nowo-ui-rail-label-collapse', 'data-nowo-ui-rail-label-expand', 'data-nowo-ui-rail-persist', 'data-nowo-ui-rail-state-url', 'data-nowo-ui-rail-state-token', 'data-nowo-ui-rail-state-panel', 'data-nowo-ui-rail-shortcut']) %}
{% set _key_ok = (persist ?? null) is not null and persist is not iterable and (persist ~ '') matches '/^[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]{1,64}$/D' %}
{% set _persist = _key_ok ? persist : null %}
{% set _state_url = nowo_ui_safe_href(state_url|default(null)) %}
{% set _shortcut = shortcut|default(null) %}
{% if _href %}<a href="{{ _href }}" role="button"{% else %}<button type="button"{% endif %} class="{{ nowo_ui_class('rail_toggle', _b) }} nowo-ui-rail-toggle--{{ _side }}{{ (_attr.class ?? false) ? ' ' ~ _attr.class }}" aria-controls="{{ target }}" aria-expanded="{{ _collapsed ? 'false' : 'true' }}" data-nowo-ui-rail-toggle data-nowo-ui-rail-label-collapse="{{ _collapse }}" data-nowo-ui-rail-label-expand="{{ _expand }}"{% if _persist %} data-nowo-ui-rail-persist="{{ _persist }}"{% endif %}{% if _state_url %} data-nowo-ui-rail-state-url="{{ _state_url }}"{% if state_token|default(null) %} data-nowo-ui-rail-state-token="{{ state_token }}"{% endif %}{% if state_panel|default(null) %} data-nowo-ui-rail-state-panel="{{ state_panel }}"{% endif %}{% endif %}{% if _shortcut %} aria-keyshortcuts="{{ _shortcut }}" data-nowo-ui-rail-shortcut="{{ _shortcut }}"{% endif %}{{ nowo_ui_attrs('rail_toggle', _b) }}{{ nowo_ui_html_attrs(nowo_ui_attrs_without_class(_attr)) }}>
    <span class="nowo-ui-rail-toggle__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ include('@NowoUiKitBundle/components/_icon.html.twig', {name: 'chevron_left', label: _collapsed ? _expand : _collapse}, false)|trim|raw }}</span>
    <span class="visually-hidden" data-nowo-ui-rail-toggle-label>{{ _collapsed ? _expand : _collapse }}</span>
    {% if show_title ?? true %}<span class="nowo-ui-rail-toggle__title" aria-hidden="true">{{ _title }}</span>{% endif %}
{% if _href %}</a>{% else %}</button>{% endif %}
